menu "e32p: foo (TEMPLATE)"

    config E32P_FOO_ENABLE
        bool "Enable e32p_foo (template)"
        default n
        help
            Example enable switch. Copy this file when creating a new module and
            rename FOO/foo to your module name. Add `depends on SOC_<FEATURE>_SUPPORTED`
            for chip-specific peripherals so disabled targets hide the option.

endmenu
